{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve containment when every clock sample is interrupted**\n\nUsing the midpoint leaves up to half the sampling window of epoch error. When all three samples encounter scheduler or GC stalls, `InvocationOtelPlugin` can place ordinary user spans outside their SDK parents; the added stalled-sample test explicitly skips containment when this occurs. Retain the bracket endpoints and use conservative lower/upper bounds for starts and ends, then require containment in every stalled fixture.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs77AviX","finding_digest":"eb83580fb6c6151f56b816d070253ecd2eea42747ad77dfe9353b102e28878f5","finding_id":"arf_v1_5obvqd5wyykr6vvyc3ihajj6zu","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts::captureinvocationclock::stalled-sample-containment","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts::captureinvocationclock::stalled-sample-containment","line":27,"observation_digest":"147f343a3dfa70863511b8237a8d9f66ef57eefae2ac8868f2750a86b4ca6703","observation_id":"aro_v1_cr7tior57jyimnirxarxvdm7m3","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5obvqd5wyykr6vvyc3ihajj6zu","published_at":"2026-10-07T19:49:16Z","review_id":"arr_v1_zbbwzfct4kmr2vkmaaau7xc3ht","reviewed_base_sha":"36255031ce94f17e2fc7e458286b668f9ce7596a","reviewed_head_sha":"d189fa9600860ff17084c8e14a8e7787da03044e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":23,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":962},"record_id":"art_v1_vm32p4jrc2a5b7dnzk7wgcceb6","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T19:49:16Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
